{
"file": 795,
"paths": [
"d008/d067/f014"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "528bba7b",
"en_raw": "Egg boro cookies"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "168f42f4",
"en_raw": "I'll bring some along..."
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "d0b7c2a8",
"en_raw": "Or maybe hard candy"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "eaceeefb",
"en_raw": "would be better..."
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "94ac0571",
"en_raw": "Grandpa"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "49a6fc1f",
"en_raw": "never forgets, you know"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "f3e85080",
"en_raw": "I wish they'd come"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "7abae906",
"en_raw": "to pick me up soon..."
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "02df979b",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "b4510347",
"en_raw": "When it's this hot"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "915adcd5",
"en_raw": "I lose the will to work"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "aab8e485",
"en_raw": "You never had it to begin with"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "25abd5cc",
"en_raw": "This summer is hot"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "e4554aa4",
"en_raw": "You ask that every year"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "bc11f854",
"en_raw": "This outfit suits me, right?"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "bb2c6c81",
"en_raw": "Well"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "2d9d23b4",
"en_raw": "Hmm?"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "cef9049f",
"en_raw": "Are you interested in me?"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "1717d826",
"en_raw": "There's no way"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "677db820",
"en_raw": "Students should just go to school."
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "14d6578b",
"en_raw": "Adults should just work"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "d54e2289",
"en_raw": "You kids get home before dark."
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "bf01f503",
"en_raw": "True, adults are dangerous too"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "b17276d3",
"en_raw": "Hm? Did you say something?"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "7131f9bd",
"en_raw": "No..."
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "efd19715",
"en_raw": "Keep the dog away"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "f1cd3885",
"en_raw": "I'm not good with them..."
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "92838cd2",
"en_raw": "Hmph..."
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "b32e4b56",
"en_raw": "What's this dog's name?"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "633c1adc",
"en_raw": "It's Melos"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "b737a232",
"en_raw": "It's hot"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "e4ef3546",
"en_raw": "Makes me want to go to the sea"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "70a424f4",
"en_raw": "Yes"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "4fc5e8cc",
"en_raw": "So hot, I feel dizzy."
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "f35bf640",
"en_raw": "Huh"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "68595741",
"en_raw": "Having fun, junior high kids?"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "5c7c39d0",
"en_raw": "No"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "ca63c3f3",
"en_raw": "Sorry, I'm in a hurry right now."
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "6d4a1d04",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "417694cb",
"en_raw": "Hm??"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "8f131ad9",
"en_raw": "Leave me alone!"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "6d4a1d04",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "e24704de",
"en_raw": "Rare for junior high kids to talk to me."
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "09ce1925",
"en_raw": "Is that so?"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "d811e9c2",
"en_raw": "You're being fooled... you kids."
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "51729e20",
"en_raw": "???"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "e4aa50e8",
"en_raw": "The season I hate is here..."
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "3d865af1",
"en_raw": "I see"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "183d9a48",
"en_raw": "When it's hot I remember bad things..."
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "3d865af1",
"en_raw": "I see"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "4ec5d7f9",
"en_raw": "Um"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "877029c2",
"en_raw": "You probably don't know, though"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "4fd2f979",
"en_raw": "Then don't ask"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "e44662ea",
"en_raw": "What are you doing!"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "d20d21c1",
"en_raw": "I didn't do anything"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "fbb810a6",
"en_raw": "What?"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "6669cce8",
"en_raw": "No, it's nothing"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "51087b63",
"en_raw": "I feel like I've seen your face before."
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "082a6f45",
"en_raw": "Do I look like someone? Me?"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "7ace2674",
"en_raw": "I'm a hopeless case anyway."
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "f6854147",
"en_raw": "You'll understand when you look"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "0f1edb0d",
"en_raw": "I'm going to the pool next!!"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "0774ffcc",
"en_raw": "Yeah"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "4f694609",
"en_raw": "I'm going to the sea, nice, right!!"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "f6341425",
"en_raw": "Whatever"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "e4f9e705",
"en_raw": "Your shoelace is untied~"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "5d719f9b",
"en_raw": "Liar"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "2aa36cce",
"en_raw": "What?! ...Tch."
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "ac7fc862",
"en_raw": "What is this about"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "731ec776",
"en_raw": "Hey, is junior high fun?"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "8359f88e",
"en_raw": "True, a gang of cheap monkeys"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "65f6dfce",
"en_raw": "playing at being friends"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "7faed635",
"en_raw": "I found some sunflower seeds earlier."
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "b84084e6",
"en_raw": "Hmm"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "675b5fa3",
"en_raw": "Did you see the rainbow?"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "ba53eae5",
"en_raw": "Birds have it good, they look so happy..."
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "1940befa",
"en_raw": "Go see the egrets. The egrets!"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "113e36da",
"en_raw": "There are pigeons in the park too."
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "ced71668",
"en_raw": "The view from Hirumi Bridge is lovely."
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "e2141831",
"en_raw": "The view from Takadai Street is great."
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "3f6659d4",
"en_raw": "It's getting hot, isn't it?"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "fbc761d6",
"en_raw": "That's right"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "81953a8f",
"en_raw": "Hot, hot."
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "c32f003d",
"en_raw": "Right"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "f592daa8",
"en_raw": "Oh my, Yuki-chan"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "bf684ff4",
"en_raw": "Say hello to your mother for me."
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "db2c3b33",
"en_raw": "Huh...?"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "ca373e1d",
"en_raw": "So many crows in this town."
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "eae508e9",
"en_raw": "Don't you think?"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "fbc761d6",
"en_raw": "That's right"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "7ae19f3b",
"en_raw": "Busy day in, day out."
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "bd1c9009",
"en_raw": "It wears me down."
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "f35bf640",
"en_raw": "Huh"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "dad941f0",
"en_raw": "Oh, walking the dog?"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "4384345e",
"en_raw": "Yes, sort of"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "d0da2117",
"en_raw": "They say kids these days are dangerous,"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "e2fe46ab",
"en_raw": "but that's not true, is it?"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "fb8b191e",
"en_raw": "You think so?"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "13dcbebf",
"en_raw": "Ugh, it's hot"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "6ebda3b0",
"en_raw": "Take care"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "bffd8418",
"en_raw": "What lovely weather."
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "fbc761d6",
"en_raw": "That's right"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "a75ec0cf",
"en_raw": "You're lively, kiddo"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "951585ed",
"en_raw": "Huh? Kiddo...?"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "cae98cbe",
"en_raw": "How dreadful, how dreadful..."
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "629e34fa",
"en_raw": "........."
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "19c40759",
"en_raw": "Long ago, all of this around here"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "df88dbc2",
"en_raw": "was nothing but fields."
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "b84084e6",
"en_raw": "Hmm"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "82bc564f",
"en_raw": "It's hot, isn't it"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "c32f003d",
"en_raw": "Right"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "b4510347",
"en_raw": "When it's this hot"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "9e8f668d",
"en_raw": "Doesn't it make you feel strange?"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "db90eb27",
"en_raw": "Huh?"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "f1500649",
"en_raw": "Must be nice, kids are so innocent."
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "cdc3864a",
"en_raw": "There are a lot of adults like that"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "b8d28215",
"en_raw": "A cheeky brat..."
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "8a9bc780",
"en_raw": "Tch"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "f297a8e4",
"en_raw": "Hmm"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "84638dd9",
"en_raw": "You're so cute"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "1a162b47",
"en_raw": "Thank you"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "563a960c",
"en_raw": "...Hmph"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "05a6ec8c",
"en_raw": "Eh? What is it?"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "2f1827c7",
"en_raw": "I don't really understand."
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "2e9ed958",
"en_raw": "I didn't say anything"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "40873692",
"en_raw": "3544, 3545..."
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "b35b331e",
"en_raw": "Ahh, I lost count."
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "d74bb384",
"en_raw": "What?"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "b8bb610b",
"en_raw": "Yikes, a big dog."
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "c2d96c6b",
"en_raw": "So he says, Melos"
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "b97501fc",
"en_raw": "No, no, no, no."
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "5c0d357b",
"en_raw": "I can't stand dogs."
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "01c198fd",
"en_raw": "Here, Melos"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "f6fefb2c",
"en_raw": "Come here"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "8f50e23a",
"en_raw": "Is this Pochi? Not?"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "6275c87d",
"en_raw": "Then from now on you're Pochi"
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "3e23a45f",
"en_raw": "How selfish"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "2ef5a932",
"en_raw": "Cute dog. Is it a mutt?"
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "15b8449c",
"en_raw": "Right, as hard as you can"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "97679038",
"en_raw": "I love the heat."
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "3733884f",
"en_raw": "Oh"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "00c34fc1",
"en_raw": "What? Something on my face?"
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "e8fe609d",
"en_raw": "No"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "dc2368cd",
"en_raw": "Ohh?"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "dc5c2514",
"en_raw": "Huh?"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "601afda2",
"en_raw": "School's so boring, you know."
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "edb8d580",
"en_raw": "Then don't go"
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "7761fa94",
"en_raw": "Aww, so cute!"
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "629e34fa",
"en_raw": "........."
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "a3f8d0d5",
"en_raw": "Hey!!"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "63edc948",
"en_raw": "I told you I hate dogs!!"
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "c2470f7a",
"en_raw": "Hot..."
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "f1bc3748",
"en_raw": "It's rough in this heat"
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "63685714",
"en_raw": "Really"
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "5d246444",
"en_raw": "Oh, come on!!"
},
{
"n": 160,
"h": "a1439217",
"en_raw": "I forgot what I was thinking about."
},
{
"n": 161,
"h": "2d023aa9",
"en_raw": "Excuse me"
},
{
"n": 162,
"h": "8f129b69",
"en_raw": "You boys watch out for cars, okay?"
},
{
"n": 163,
"h": "6310ad13",
"en_raw": "Yes, thanks for coming all this way"
},
{
"n": 164,
"h": "ba6e6f11",
"en_raw": "Oh, good doggy"
},
{
"n": 165,
"h": "96e62f03",
"en_raw": "That's flattery"
},
{
"n": 166,
"h": "bd81325e",
"en_raw": "My, what a big doggy."
},
{
"n": 167,
"h": "5cc656b6",
"en_raw": "Bigger isn't always better"
}
]
}